  "details": "For as long as I can remember the expected value returned by Input.GetAxisRaw() on desktop when using WASD has been immediate snapping value (-1 / 0 / 1).\n\nIn open beta Input.GetAxisRaw() returns completely unexpected values that appear to be interpolated and also stutter whenever the axis input changes direction.\n\nThe steering algorithm of my vehicles expect the most responsive raw input coming from the user, but current inputs provided by open beta cause everything to break, resulting in the steering feeling like a drunk simulator.",
